Reordered the common profile-lookup path and added branch hints so the invalid-type/profile-sweep case falls through, reducing taken branches during decoding and profile sweeps.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 0))
        return type;

    const auto p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p != nullptr, 1) && __builtin_expect(profileIndex < p->numFields, 1))
        return p->fields[profileIndex].type;

    return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;
}
```